# MASTER PROMPT: ALL-IN-ONE AUTONOMOUS DEVELOPMENT AI AGENT FOR ANDROID

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, functional, production-oriented Android application called **Hermes Dev Agent**.

This application will be an all-in-one AI software development agent inspired by Hermes Agent. It must provide a chat-based interface through which users can create software projects, inspect source code, install development tools, import GitHub skills, execute authorized shell commands, build applications, run tests, debug errors, and deliver verified artifacts.

The agent must perform real work using actual tools and execution environments. It must never pretend to execute commands, invent tool outputs, or claim a task is completed without evidence.

The result must be a genuine Android Studio project with a functional backend, real agent integration, automated tests, documentation, and a successfully built debug APK.

Do not create a mockup-only application or leave core features as placeholder functions.

